// Windows resource file: embeds blipblop.ico as the executable's icon
// (shown in Explorer, the taskbar, and Alt-Tab). Placeholder art - see
// blipblop.ico's own generation notes; swap the .ico file for real art
// whenever it's ready, no other changes needed here.
//
// Plain numeric ID (not a symbolic #define'd one) - Windows picks the
// lowest-numbered ICON resource in the module as the exe's own icon,
// and a bare number here avoids needing an accompanying resource.h.
101 ICON "blipblop.ico"
